      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-foreground">
          <span class="text-primary mr-1.5" aria-hidden="true">&#9613;</span>Joe Robinson
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-2">SEO and GEO consultant for SaaS and tech companies</p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">Two or three retained clients at a time.</p>
